issue(id="0027" status="review")
  title Upgrade November workflow tooling
  user-story
    as-a Repository maintainer
    i-want Current stable mise, Renovate, and crates.io authentication tooling.
    so-that CI and releases receive upstream maintenance improvements.
  premise.
    GitHub Actions remain pinned to full commit SHAs and mise remains pinned to an explicit release. This change affects repository automation.
  acceptance-criteria
    criterion The mise action uses v5.2.5 and installs mise 2026.10.25.
    criterion The Renovate action uses v46.3.12.
    criterion The crates.io authentication action uses v1.0.6.
    criterion Workflow validation introduces no diagnostics relative to main.
  review-items
    item(status="covered") Upstream release tags resolve to the pinned action commits.
